# Demo: editor del lienzo, ahora 5o modo del menu ENVIAR (no Juegos).
# Pintamos unos puntos variando la fila con el pote (pot = Y).
wait 300
pot 80
wait 200
tap morse
wait 200
pot 880
wait 250
in 0 morse down        # entra al editor (Dibujar)
in 120 morse up
in 400 pot 0
in 500 morse down
in 600 morse up
in 800 pot 130
in 900 morse down
in 1000 morse up
in 1200 pot 260
in 1300 morse down
in 1400 morse up
in 1700 pot 390
run 2200 120
shot demo_doodle_editor
